@* The site's settings (FX163, Louis: "a 3 line menu there which will open a sticky menu then we put those buttons
   there", "like our top menu bar, thinner maybe"): a thin glass bar under the header, opened from its three-line
   button, which stays as the page scrolls, holding the look switches and the site's own settings and lesser links. *@
